{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FFFBF8\\,#FFF2EA)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1B\\,#241E1C)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{brand.y}+({brand.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#FF6600|#FF8A3D",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "brand",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21.0pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.talkL}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "_note": "卡名说这张卡回答什么(§1.1);源身份由左边那颗 HN 橙点承担。"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${at}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "id": "title",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "32pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "3",
        "lineSpacing": "3pt",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${t0},${@i18n.talkE})]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "$[if::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${t0},__none__),__none__),0,1),#0E1116|#F3F4F6,#6B7280|#8E939B)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmt",
        "type": "richText",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{title.b}+7pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "spans": [
          {
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c0},--)]",
            "fontSize": "22pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          },
          {
            "text": "${@i18n.cmt}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "meta",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{cmt.b}+3pt",
        "w": "134.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.pA}$[findNotEmpty::(${a0},--)]${@i18n.sp}$[if::(eq::(${u0},1),${@i18n.uM},if::(eq::(${u0},3),${@i18n.uD},${@i18n.uH}))]${@i18n.qB}$[findNotEmpty::(${p0},--)]${@i18n.pts}",
        "fontSize": "9.5pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "「18 小时前发布 · 928 分」。⚠️ 用普通 txt 的字符串内插而不是 connect:: —— 后者按逗号切参数并吃掉两侧空格。"
      }
    ],
    "i18nEmptyOk": [
      "sp",
      "pA"
    ],
    "_note_i18nEmptyOk": "这些键有一半语言**刻意为空**,不是漏译:中文把数字夹在句中(「最近 24 小时新上榜 4 条」「14 小时前发布」),英文放句首 / 紧排(「4 new in the last 24h」「Posted 14h ago」)。少了这条声明,lint 会对一份翻译完整的表恒报 warn。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "pts": " 分",
        "cmt": " 评论",
        "talkL": "讨论最热",
        "talkE": "暂无数据",
        "uM": "分钟前",
        "uH": "小时前",
        "uD": "天前",
        "sp": " ",
        "pA": "",
        "qB": "发布 · "
      },
      "en-US": {
        "pts": " pts",
        "cmt": " comments",
        "talkL": "Most talked",
        "talkE": "No data",
        "uM": "m ago",
        "uH": "h ago",
        "uD": "d ago",
        "sp": "",
        "pA": "Posted ",
        "qB": " · "
      }
    }
  }
}
